From 81450510d5785d86a358e61707185133a746a0ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: RealHaltewunsch <julius.merz@web.de>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 23:05:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Configure Compact-500 vacuum sensors and correct X
 direction

Add PE3-selected HBP1201D support using complete signed 24-bit pressure codes, automatic ambient zero at boot, and OpenPnP-compatible vacuum_level output.

Set Compact-500 XY travel to 333 x 387 mm and invert X so positive motion moves away from X-MIN. Keep the original ring-light timings and startup behavior.

Document native Apple Silicon builds and hardware bring-up results. The flashed X-direction build passed byte-for-byte readback and the motor direction was confirmed on hardware. Full G28 Z remains dependent on X/Y homing.
